        "note": "October 11, 2026 (Doug: setup downloads the larger music model so Extract, Replace and Complete work). The model card's front matter declares license: mit; the repository has no standalone LICENSE file. Its config.json has is_turbo false, so the engine offers it every task type including extract, lego and complete. SUPERSEDED the same day: the engine's list is only an is_turbo check; the publisher's model card lists xl-sft as \"Standard\" and the engine's own model table marks Extract, Lego and Complete as unsupported for it. Those three tasks are for acestep-v15-xl-base (see its entry below)."
