        "licenseDeclarationFile": "README.md",
        "licenseDeclarationBytes": 4749,
        "note": "October 11, 2026 (Doug: make every feature of the music page work). The model card's front matter declares license: mit; the repository has no standalone LICENSE file. The card calls this the foundation model that supports all tasks (text-to-music, cover, repaint, extract, lego, complete) and names \"All (extract, lego, complete)\" for it alone among the XL models; acestep-v15-xl-sft is listed as \"Standard\". Its config.json is byte-identical to the one in acestep-v15-xl-sft, so nothing in the file distinguishes the two and the page decides by model name (see acegen.PUBLISHED_TASKS)."
